                url: "docs/vehicles/t-34-85.md",
                note: "8100 mm gun forward with the ZiS-S-53 (ru.wikipedia; historyofwar) — the D-5T run's 8300 is not this vehicle.",
            ),
            status: Locked,
        ),
        DimensionTarget(
            kind: HullWidth,
            target_m: 3.0,
            tolerance_m: 0.03,
            source: ReferenceSource(
                label: "T-34-85 dossier (Reference anatomy)",
                url: "docs/vehicles/t-34-85.md",
                note: "3000 mm over the tracks (ru.wikipedia; historyofwar; armor.photos); the upper sides overhang the belts to the full beam.",
            ),
            status: Locked,
